### hannote 评论服务二期接口测试（IntelliJ HTTP Client）
#
# gateway 环境：{{commentHost}}=http://localhost:8000，{{commentBasePath}}=/comment
# direct 环境：{{commentHost}}=http://localhost:8090，{{commentBasePath}}=""
# 经网关路径遵循当前 StripPrefix 双段规则：/comment/comment/*。

### 1. 发布一级评论（异步落库）
POST {{commentHost}}{{commentBasePath}}/comment/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
userId: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteId": {{noteId}},
  "content": "评论服务二期联调评论",
  "imageUrl": ""
}

> {%
    client.test("发布评论请求已受理", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "HTTP 状态非 200");
        client.assert(response.body.success === true, JSON.stringify(response.body));
    });
%}

### 2. 一级评论分页
POST {{commentHost}}{{commentBasePath}}/comment/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
userId: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "noteId": {{noteId}},
  "pageNo": 1
}

> {%
    client.test("一级评论分页字段完整", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "HTTP 状态非 200");
        client.assert(response.body.success === true, JSON.stringify(response.body));
        client.assert(response.body.pageSize === 10, "pageSize 应为 10");
        client.assert(response.body.commentTotal >= response.body.totalCount,
            "commentTotal 不应小于一级评论总数");
    });
%}

### 3. 二级评论分页（parentCommentId 需替换为真实一级评论 ID）
POST {{commentHost}}{{commentBasePath}}/comment/child/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
userId: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parentCommentId": {{parentCommentId}},
  "pageNo": 1
}

### 4. 点赞评论
POST {{commentHost}}{{commentBasePath}}/comment/like
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
userId: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commentId": {{commentId}}
}

### 5. 取消点赞评论
POST {{commentHost}}{{commentBasePath}}/comment/unlike
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
userId: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commentId": {{commentId}}
}

### 6. 删除本人评论（会级联删除对应回复分支）
POST {{commentHost}}{{commentBasePath}}/comment/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
userId: {{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commentId": {{commentId}}
}
